# ── CORS Proxy for TMDB API (production override) ──
# Direct api.themoviedb.org calls time out on many networks (e.g. ISP/regional
# blocks), so the deployed site routes requests through proxy.cors.sh.
# - Supports public browser origins (Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *)
# - Free tier: ~10,000 requests/month — plenty for a portfolio/demo site
# - The {url} placeholder is substituted with the full TMDB URL (raw).
#
# If TMDB becomes reachable directly, remove this line to call the API
# without a proxy:  VITE_CORS_PROXY=
VITE_CORS_PROXY=https://proxy.cors.sh/{url}
